            "//ccm": "4559 K matrix from Raspberry Pi libcamera src/ipa/rpi/vc4/data/imx477.json (BSD-2-Clause), fetched 2026-11-09. Single entry: gray-world AWB does not export a colour temperature, so a CT-indexed table would always pick one row anyway. low_luma stays identity so dark scenes do not amplify noise.",
