                    }
                ]
            },
            "//blc": "Sensor black level 4096/65536 of full scale per Raspberry Pi libcamera src/ipa/rpi/vc4/data/imx477.json (BSD-2-Clause), fetched 2026-11-09 = 64 at 10-bit = 16 at the ISP 8-bit scale (same 16 the Arducam IMX500/Pivariety configs use). Verify with the lens cap on: dark frame should read near-black and neutral.",
            "blc": {
